WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.866
Step 1. Open the products. A product is one batch of a Product Knowledge.

1.2
00:00:05.866 --> 00:00:12.796
In Settings, in the Inventory group, select Product.

2.1
00:00:12.796 --> 00:00:19.802
Step 2. Find the product. Use the Lot Number and Expires columns to find the batch.

3.1
00:00:19.802 --> 00:00:25.040
Step 3. Open the product. Select View on its row.

4.1
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:31.231
Step 4. Start the edit. Select Edit to open the Edit Product form.

5.1
00:00:31.231 --> 00:00:36.482
Step 5. Change the details. Here, the Standard Pack Size changes to 12,

5.2
00:00:36.482 --> 00:00:40.497
and a charge item definition is picked from its category.

5.3
00:00:40.497 --> 00:00:43.815
You cannot change the Product Knowledge.

6.1
00:00:43.815 --> 00:00:47.328
Step 6. Save the changes. Select Update.

6.2
00:00:47.328 --> 00:00:53.294
Care shows Product updated successfully and opens the product page.
